    tip: `Expected results – Part_Time_Staff: 3 records (E04, E08, E10). FB_Salary2500: 3 records (E02, E07, E09); in the report, sorted by LastName, they appear as E02, E07, E09. "Or more" means >=2500. For the Yes/No criterion candidates should type No (or False / 0) in the FullTime criteria cell, not "No" in quotation marks.`
