    title: 'Term fee reminder letters to parents',
    org: 'Maraval Dance Academy',
    brief: `<p>Maraval Dance Academy is preparing for its Christmas Showcase. The Director must send a polite reminder to five parents whose children still have a balance on their Term 1 fees. Each letter must state the dancer’s name, class, the amount outstanding and the date by which it must be paid.</p>`,
    data: `<p><b>(a) Primary document</b> – key this exactly; text shown as «FieldName» is a merge field to be inserted, not typed.</p><div style="text-align:center"><b>MARAVAL DANCE ACADEMY</b><br>5 Saddle Road, Maraval, Trinidad<br>Telephone: +1 (868) 622 2187  ·  E-mail: office@maravaldance.tt</div><p>6 November 2026</p><p>«Title» «FirstName» «LastName»<br>«Address1»<br>«District»<br>Trinidad</p><p>Dear «Title» «LastName»</p><p><b>REMINDER – TERM 1 FEES FOR «DancerName»</b></p><p>Our records show that the Term 1 fees for «DancerName», who attends the «Class» class, have not yet been paid in full. The outstanding balance is «AmountDue».</p><p>Please settle this balance by «DueDate» at the Academy office, which is open from Monday to Friday, 3:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m., or by bank transfer quoting your child’s name. Dancers whose fees are outstanding after this date will not be able to take part in the Christmas Showcase on Saturday, 12 December 2026.</p><p>If you have already made this payment, please accept our thanks and disregard this letter.</p><p>Yours sincerely</p><p><br><br>Miss Celeste Mohammed<br>Director</p><p><b>(b) Data source</b> – field names: <b>Title</b>, <b>FirstName</b>, <b>LastName</b>, <b>Address1</b>, <b>District</b>, <b>DancerName</b>, <b>Class</b>, <b>AmountDue</b>, <b>DueDate</b> (5 records)</p><table style="border:1px solid #999"><thead><tr><th>Title</th><th>FirstName</th><th>LastName</th><th>Address1</th><th>District</th><th>DancerName</th><th>Class</th><th>AmountDue</th><th>DueDate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mrs</td><td>Natasha</td><td>Lewis</td><td>14 Cottonwood Drive</td><td>Maraval</td><td>Imani Lewis</td><td>Junior Ballet</td><td>TT$85.00</td><td>20 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Mr</td><td>Patrick</td><td>Samuel</td><td>3 Ebony Street</td><td>Cascade</td><td>Ava Samuel</td><td>Modern Dance</td><td>TT$120.00</td><td>20 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Ms</td><td>Carla</td><td>Reyes</td><td>25 Almond Grove</td><td>Diego Martin</td><td>Sofia Reyes</td><td>Junior Ballet</td><td>TT$42.50</td><td>20 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Mrs</td><td>Dionne</td><td>Gibbs</td><td>9 Hope Road</td><td>Petit Valley</td><td>Leah Gibbs</td><td>Caribbean Folk Dance</td><td>TT$160.00</td><td>27 November 2026</td></tr><tr><td>Mr</td><td>Raymond</td><td>Hughes</td><td>47 Morne Coco Road</td><td>Glencoe</td><td>Mia Hughes</td><td>Modern Dance</td><td>TT$60.00</td><td>27 November 2026</td></tr></tbody></table>`,
