      `Write a conclusion, then list all references in APA style and use in-text citations in the body.`,
      `Produce the report (maximum 1000 words, excluding tables, charts, references and appendices) with a cover page, acknowledgements, table of contents, page numbers, consistent headings and sub-headings, references and appendices (permission letter, workplan, blank instrument).`
